title: IBM TS4300: Library Status
agents: snmp
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Monitors the operational status the library reports for itself
 (computerSystem-OperationalStatus, .1.3.6.1.4.1.14851.3.1.10.2.0) and
 for every chassis of the SNIA subChassis table
 (.1.3.6.1.4.1.14851.3.1.4.10.1).

 The CIM status values are mapped as follows: {ok} is OK, {error},
 {non-recoverable error}, {aborted} and {supporting entity in error} are
 CRIT, {unknown}, {no contact} and {lost communication} are UNKNOWN,
 every other value is WARN.

 The library sends its state itself, the check has no parameters.

inventory:
 One service per host.
